{"turn":1,"units":[
{"unitId":"blue-1","x":2000,"y":1650,"facingDeg":0,"formation":"line","strength":600,"morale":80,"fatigue":3,"ammo":100,"status":"active","continuing":{"kind":"hold"},"orders":[{"orderId":"b1-8","result":"carried-out"}],"account":"Col. Aubry read the order as written: a good position near the river. He moved his line about 50 m forward and towards the road, so his right covers the south end of the bridge at musket range. He halted there to receive whatever comes over it. No enemy was in sight."},
{"unitId":"blue-2","x":2140,"y":1680,"facingDeg":0,"formation":"line","strength":550,"morale":75,"fatigue":0,"ammo":100,"status":"active","continuing":{"kind":"hold"},"orders":[],"account":"Col. Delacroix had no new orders, so he held his line east of the road and watched the far bank."},
{"unitId":"blue-3","x":2050,"y":1850,"facingDeg":0,"formation":"line","strength":200,"morale":85,"fatigue":0,"ammo":100,"status":"active","continuing":{"kind":"hold"},"orders":[],"account":"Maj. Verneuil had no orders, so he held his squadron behind the infantry, watching the road across the river for enemy movement."},
{"unitId":"red-1","x":1950,"y":300,"facingDeg":180,"formation":"line","strength":650,"morale":80,"fatigue":0,"ammo":100,"status":"active","continuing":{"kind":"hold"},"orders":[],"account":"Col. Brandt had no orders this turn, so he held his line and waited impatiently."},
{"unitId":"red-2","x":2100,"y":1100,"facingDeg":180,"formation":"column","strength":650,"morale":70,"fatigue":12,"ammo":100,"status":"active","continuing":{"kind":"move","x":2050,"y":1380},"orders":[{"orderId":"r2-8","result":"carried-out"}],"account":"Col. Hartmann read 'Push on' as an order to advance along the line of march towards the bridge, the army's objective. He formed column of march, gained the high road and went south about 950 m. By the end he could see enemy lines across the river, and he keeps marching on the bridge.","departure":"The engine left the battalion holding. The order arrived at minute 3 and plainly asks for an advance, so it marched about 960 m south in column towards the bridge."},
{"unitId":"red-3","x":1550,"y":400,"facingDeg":180,"formation":"line","strength":220,"morale":85,"fatigue":0,"ammo":100,"status":"active","continuing":{"kind":"hold"},"orders":[],"account":"Maj. von Reiter had no orders, so he held his squadron west of the road."}
],
